</span><span begin="00:58.580" end="00:59.750">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.500" end="01:04.100"><span begin="01:00.500" end="01:00.980">That's </span><span begin="01:00.980" end="01:01.520">okay </span><span begin="01:01.520" end="01:01.880">'cause </span><span begin="01:01.880" end="01:02.090">I've </span><span begin="01:02.090" end="01:02.390">got </span><span begin="01:02.390" end="01:02.570">no </span><span begin="01:02.570" end="01:03.020">self </span><span begin="01:03.020" end="01:04.100">esteem</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.240" end="01:27.080"><span begin="01:23.240" end="01:23.720">We </span><span begin="01:23.720" end="01:23.990">make </span><span begin="01:23.990" end="01:24.950">plans </span><span begin="01:24.950" end="01:25.130">to </span><span begin="01:25.130" end="01:25.550">go </span><span begin="01:25.550" end="01:25.910">out </span><span begin="01:25.910" end="01:26.060">at </span><span begin="01:26.060" end="01:27.080">night</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.890" end="01:31.640"><span begin="01:27.890" end="01:28.040">I </span><span begin="01:28.040" end="01:28.430">wait </span><span begin="01:28.430" end="01:28.670">till </span><span begin="01:28.670" end="01:29.300">2 </span><span begin="01:29.300" end="01:29.690">then </span><span begin="01:29.690" end="01:29.810">I </span><span begin="01:29.810" end="01:30.290">turn </span><span begin="01:30.290" end="01:30.530">out </span><span begin="01:30.530" end="01:30.680">the </span><span begin="01:30.680" end="01:31.640">light</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.640" end="01:36.440"><span begin="01:31.640" end="01:32.600">All </span><span begin="01:32.600" end="01:33.020">these </span><span begin="01:33.020" end="01:34.520">rejection's </span><span begin="01:34.520" end="01:34.730">got </span><span begin="01:34.730" end="01:34.940">me </span><span begin="01:34.940" end="01:35.300">so </span><span begin="01:35.300" end="01:36.440">low</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1"