a </span><span begin="02:12.290" end="02:13.310">disease</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.340" end="02:16.820"><span begin="02:13.340" end="02:13.790">Then </span><span begin="02:13.790" end="02:13.910">I </span><span begin="02:13.910" end="02:14.540">wonder </span><span begin="02:14.540" end="02:14.840">how </span><span begin="02:14.840" end="02:15.110">much </span><span begin="02:15.110" end="02:15.440">more </span><span begin="02:15.440" end="02:15.650">I </span><span begin="02:15.650" end="02:15.860">can </span><span begin="02:15.860" end="02:16.820">stand</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.510" end="02:22.220"><span begin="02:17.510" end="02:17.960">Well </span><span begin="02:17.960" end="02:18.350">I </span><span begin="02:18.350" end="02:19.460">guess </span><span begin="02:19.460" end="02:19.940">I </span><span begin="02:19.940" end="02:20.300">should </span><span begin="02:20.300" end="02:20.690">stick </span><span begin="02:20.690" end="02:20.900">up </span><span begin="02:20.900" end="02:21.170">for </span><span begin="02:21.170" end="02:22.220">myself</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.250" end="02:25.820"><span begin="02:22.250" end="02:22.700">But </span><span begin="02:22.700" end="02:22.790">I </span><span begin="02:22.790" end="02:23.330">really </span><span begin="02:23.330" end="02:23.780">think </span><span begin="02:23.780" end="02:23.900">it's </span><span begin="02:23.900" end="02:24.500">better </span><span begin="02:24.500" end="02:24.800">this </span><span begin="02:24.800" end="02:25.820">way</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.420" end="02:28.520"><span begin="02:26.420" end="02:26.600">The </span><span begin="02:26.600" end="02:27.050">more </span><span begin="02:27.050" end="02:27.200">you </span><span begin="02:27.200" end="02:28.520">suffer</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.670" end="02:44.420"><span begin="02:28.670" end="02:28.910">The </span><span begin="02:28.910" end="02:29.390">more </span><span 